{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":458841,\"title\":\"Mango Sticky Rice\",\"tagline\":\"If I find you\",\"overview\":\"Katie is a dog loving foodie who is very content with her single life. Soon, she finds herself being pressured to find love. Meanwhile, Chris, the delivery boy just wants to get her attention. Will Katie find someone who will love her for who she is? Will Chris finally win her over?\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bfSzC2EtNNz0L4VG997tI3ztTXf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2016,\"runtime\":15,\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":12000,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Mallorie Ortega\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1822440,\"name\":\"Mallorie Ortega\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iqoun189vOjEsjawr9bnHsGAPDE.jpg\"},{\"id\":1822437,\"name\":\"Mina Son\",\"character\":\"Katie\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1822438,\"name\":\"Topher Park\",\"character\":\"Chris\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/18wA86Q7yLPJVN4UKs5Lrzk4O05.jpg\"},{\"id\":1822373,\"name\":\"George Tsai\",\"character\":\"Phil\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4l05ulUteEk6Gdp2opdHlnfzvtn.jpg\"},{\"id\":1586838,\"name\":\"Jennifer Soo\",\"character\":\"Joyce\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iTNuJl7xMAlpPRp3yDzPE7EpYOM.jpg\"},{\"id\":1819694,\"name\":\"Edward Hong\",\"character\":\"Mark\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xJShA0btHLpgHvJxCInlnT9PlnZ.jpg\"},{\"id\":194624,\"name\":\"David Schroeder\",\"character\":\"Walter\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qDhIjc9j54xumOGwduIZYh9DSOX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1519709,\"name\":\"Nami Paix\",\"character\":\"Mom\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":114150,\"title\":\"Pitch Perfect\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gsFoJk9g8W3zgaipRrrURk7LbiF.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2sE6hrwfn9IV7eDlMvpIb9q1EWy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"College student Beca knows she does not want to be part of a clique, but that's exactly where she finds herself after arriving at her new school. Thrust in among mean gals, nice gals and just plain weird gals, Beca finds that the only thing they have in common is how well they sing together. She takes the women of the group out of their comfort zone of traditional arrangements and into a world of amazing harmonic combinations in a fight to the top of college music competitions.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6282,\"title\":\"Coyote Ugly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xYM0laKrEqjiRSQNvqRrXPXN3iL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f2MzXz3vjuNtSPn17ugFa6oTUmc.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Graced with a velvet voice, 21-year-old Violet Sanford heads to New York to pursue her dream of becoming a songwriter only to find her aspirations sidelined by the accolades and notoriety she receives at her \\\"day\\\" job as a barmaid at Coyote Ugly. The \\\"Coyotes\\\" as they are affectionately called tantalize customers and the media alike with their outrageous antics, making Coyote Ugly the watering hole for guys on the prowl.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1243341,\"title\":\"Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68TGPnvmZ21NBOoV5IUZ4fQDyvZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10947,\"title\":\"High School Musical\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1DGmWZjUJPeKGFRHGCA6VPFUBML.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2p1nyBVSEBiCTrrZeVSV9nIsqHr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted girl get roles in the school musical and develop a friendship that threatens East High's social order.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":243,\"title\":\"High Fidelity\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e2LZGB62GMhv3Fo8tDZjY87I81a.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tmP4COlAaowO0FniW30aatOcmMq.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his long-time girlfriend dumps him, a thirty-year-old record store owner seeks to understand why he is unlucky in love while recounting his \\\"top five breakups of all time\\\".\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":515195,\"title\":\"Yesterday\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9fYka5CQt9nrb6LOtKicysUf9NA.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t5Kp02Jzixl0KfpwthHp9ZUex9t.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A struggling musician realizes he's the only person on Earth who can remember The Beatles after waking up in an alternate reality where the group was forgotten.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198277,\"title\":\"Begin Again\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qx4HXHXt528hS4rwePZbZo20xqZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xrSRmL6pXnRfu9vKwayILkNgLP.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Gretta, a budding songwriter, finds herself alone after her boyfriend Dave ditches her. Her life gains purpose when Dan, a record label executive, notices her talent.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15157,\"title\":\"Another Cinderella Story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bW957WNXiiUvIGFaUVL7wMeD776.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bR0GpnGUCN7uxRmXtnJr9s19Jrb.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A guy who danced with what could be the girl of his dreams at a costume ball only has one hint at her identity: the Zune she left behind as she rushed home in order to make her curfew. And with a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity in front of him, he sets out to find his masked beauty.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Comedy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":369557,\"title\":\"Sing Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sUWpVlrvzU2SJbnVZqIeKulPKwk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eiJ8s0akgzHFhbMxw75B6UtRzQ4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A boy growing up in Dublin during the 1980s escapes his strained family life by starting a band to impress the mysterious girl he likes.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11172,\"title\":\"Music and Lyrics\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1WXVpnovC0EETbqcjVhy3hwIITK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cLZsdMMC3hoVQy9xwn3YJ4CR9Pd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A washed-up '80s pop star gets a chance at a comeback when reigning pop diva Cora Corman invites him to write & record a duet with her, but there's a problem--Alex hasn't written a song in years; he's never written lyrics and he has to come up with a hit in a matter of days.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":18126,\"title\":\"Hannah Montana: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iVQPlpZUeQh4nh8bDnMLLhXifAN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sGqepjVCkXeG7IDPNnvpT8G3AyW.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Miley Stewart (aka pop-star Hannah Montana) gets too caught up in the superstar celebrity lifestyle, her dad decides it's time for a total change of scenery. But sweet niblets! Miley must trade in all the glitz and glamour of Hollywood for some ol' blue jeans on the family farm in Tennessee, and question if she can be both Miley Stewart and Hannah Montana.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":606117,\"title\":\"A Cinderella Story: Christmas Wish\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ozBX0u5caaJFli9AssqJmARb5R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9O79JFP9C2DY8eQ653A2gDcrwkx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kat is an aspiring singer-songwriter who dreams of making it big. However, her dreams are stalled by her reality: a conniving and cruel stepfamily  and a demoralizing job working as a singing elf at billionaire Terrence Wintergarden’s Santa Land.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Music\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"w4vlEVaRLrk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"f_IRRoaWue4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"kDCq5psaHoY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}